{
  "_comment": [
    "Single canonical source list for the H-Exo kernel.",
    "tools/verify.ps1 builds exactly this list. build_now.ps1 has its own copy;",
    "verify.ps1 cross-checks the two and fails if they have diverged, so the list",
    "cannot silently rot in one place only.",
    "Order matters only in that every entry must exist; the link step passes all",
    "objects explicitly, so link order is the linker's problem, not ours."
